Description: OpenType text shaping engine (shared library) - Ladybird pin 10.2.0
 HarfBuzz is an implementation of the OpenType Layout engine. This build (for
 the Ladybird leaf closure) is meson-built WITH freetype and ICU and WITHOUT
 glib/gobject/cairo/graphite2.
 .
 This package contains the core shared library (libharfbuzz.0.dylib).
